==Battleground==
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*20 [[Snowball]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Ice Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Snowball]]s spawn, delay 33.33~53.33 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,600f</sup>.
**2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Snowball]]s spawn, delay 33.33~53.33 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Snowball]]s spawn, delay 33.33~53.33 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,600f</sup>.
**1 [[Doge]] spawns.
**1 [[Snache]] spawns.
**1 [[Snache]] spawns.
**1 [[Those Guys]] spawns.
**4 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

==Trivia==
*''Langue de Chat'' is French for "[[wikipedia:Cat tongue|cat tongue]]", a type of cookie or biscuit named for its cat-tongue-like shape.
*Like all [[Cats in the Snow]] stages, Langue de Chat's Japanese name, Shiroi Henjintachi ("White Weirdos") is a reference to a song, in this case "[https://youtu.be/pvqvBAA-0AE Shiroi Koibitotachi]" ("White Lovers") by [[wikipedia:Keisuke Kuawata|Keisuke Kuawata]].

